できた海）」「白木の扉」「宇宙」「船（アルゴは船首の欠けた星座の名）」等です。\n・暗い色の背景に白抜きのロゴを配置するイメージです。\n\nもし気が向きましたら、ご検討ください。\n以上、よろしくお願いいたします。", "nc": 16, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}], "sent_works": [], "similar_creators": [{"id": 1835971, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": false, "acceptable": true, "name": "壺西", "screen_name": "981Id", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1996178206077136896/M-e2_GCI.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/1429717866354405383/1764563563/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 30, "complete_expiration_days": 60, "skills": [{"genre": "art"}], "nc": 145}, {"id": 2687061, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": true, "acceptable": true, "name": "White Liluck", "screen_name": "whiteliluck__", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1633833817508286465/e5CNf7sx.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/1633827834782429189/1678779936/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 5, "complete_expiration_days": 30, "skills": [{"genre": "art"}, {"genre": "comic"}, {"genre": "novel"}, {"genre": "correction"}], "nc": 32}, {"id": 2773608, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": false, "acceptable": false, "name": "絹生", "screen_name": "hitoriYKNK", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1668962501919404032/96f7Lrg2.png", "header_url": null, "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 30, "complete_expiration_days": 90, "skills": [{"genre": "art"}], "nc": 17}, {"id": 2924003, "creator": true, "nsfw_accept